    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32687" root="غيب" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَيْبَةٌ</span></b>  an inf. n. [See 1, in several places.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Also, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَيَابَةٌ</span></b> , <i>A low,</i> or <i>depressed, piece of
land</i> or <i>ground:</i> so in the phrases <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَقَعْنَا فِى غَيْبَةٍ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَيَابَةٍ</span> [app. meaning <i>We lighted upon a low,</i>
or <i>depressed, piece</i> &amp;c.; or perhaps the meaning
may be <i>we fell into</i> &amp;c.]. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَيَابَةٌ</span>.

